ore.\n\nMajority of the characters have fun game play mechanics, however there is no character balance and no reason to play anything other then the latest 2/3 over tuned characters.\n\nThere is no real end game anymore. What endgame there was has been turned into bullet sponges with minimal half baked \"mechanics\"  and finding the character that has the best \"Delete XXX in 24 secs\" build to brag about on Youtube.\n\nThe story is half baked and generic, not a bad thing in itself but its told so poorly and the voice acting is so bad it feels like AI most of the time. There are a few good moments though and the graphics are great in some of the cut scenes.", "timestamp_created": 1755286654, "timestamp_updated": 1755286981, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.515503883361816406", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "202201413", "author": {"steamid": "76561198126070770", "personaname": "hoangdaitan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198126070770/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 87608, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1927, "playtime_at_review": 52836, "last_played": 1790868813, "avatar": "93efe0c16960050c50b67070c30ac334681f75da"}, "language": "english", "review": "880Hrs when comment\nGun, Girl, Skill, Graphic, Beauty. All matching to me", "timestamp_created": 1755285325, "timestamp_updated": 1755285325, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "202197705", "author": {"st